 "$comment": "Gift cards (lib/giftcards.js), on the kernel. A card is a node of the gift-card kind in its store's namespace: its amount, unit, state, occasion, source and dates are attributes in time; its code, recipient, recipient's address, message, buyer and redeemer are sealed; it is found by a keyed blind index of its code, never by the code. The cards a party bought or was given sit under that party's holder node in the held hierarchy. A card's life is the gift_card machine. Its money lands, when redeemed, in the wallet of the definition the gift_cards capability names.",
